        "text": "Today I will present my Onward! Essay \"<https://2024.splashcon.org/details/splash-2024-Onward-Essays/3/Redressing-the-balance-a-yin-yang-perspective-on-information-technology|Redressing the Balance: A Yin-Yang Perspective on Information Technology>\" at SPLASH (as a remote participant). It will be live-streamed at 18:00 UTC <https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=L1pOMC41bS8|on YouTube>.\n\nThe topic is how computing technology can be made to better support processes of learning, understanding, and trusting, for individuals or for society as a whole (we call it \"science\" then). Such support has requirements very different from those for designing and constructing software systems for deployment as tools.",
